     2	title: "CLAUDE.mdとAGENTS.mdは非対話CLIで効く？4ケースで確認した手順と限界"
     3	emoji: "🧭"
     4	type: tech
     5	topics: ["claudecode", "codex", "aiagent", "cli"]
     6	published: false
